{"t":"MLM","n":"Martin Marietta Materials, Inc.","nKo":"마틴 마리에타 머티리얼즈","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":521.31,"chg":20.57,"chgPct":0.04108,"prev":500.74,"dayH":521.91,"dayL":505.0,"w52H":710.97,"w52L":464.92,"vol":908975,"avgVol":720000,"mcap":37074780160,"pe":38.9,"fpe":29.28,"eps":13.4,"feps":17.8,"pb":2.1,"div":3.36,"divY":0.0064,"beta":1.03,"short":3369330,"shortPct":0.0529,"shortRatio":4.15,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Basic Materials","sKo":"기초재료","i":"Building Materials","iKo":"건축자재","city":"Raleigh","emp":9600,"web":"https://www.martinmarietta.com","sum":"Martin Marietta Materials, Inc., a natural resource-based building materials company, supplies aggregates and heavy-side building materials to the construction industry in the United States and internationally. It operates through East Group and West Group segments. The company offers crushed stone, sand, and gravel products; ready mixed concrete and asphalt; and paving products and services for use in the infrastructure projects, and nonresidential and residential construction projects, as well as in the railroad, agricultural, utility, and environmental industries. It also produces magnesia-based chemicals products, and dolomitic lime primarily to customers for steel production and soil stabilization. Its chemical products are used in flame retardants, wastewater treatment, pulp and pape","sumKo":"천연자원을 기반으로 한 건축 자재 회사인 Martin Marietta Materials, Inc.는 미국 및 해외 건설 업계에 골재 및 중량 건축 자재를 공급합니다. East Group 및 West Group 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 쇄석, 모래, 자갈 제품을 제공합니다. 레미콘 및 아스팔트; 인프라 프로젝트, 비거주 및 주거용 건설 프로젝트, 철도, 농업, 유틸리티 및 환경 산업에 사용하기 위한 포장 제품 및 서비스. 또한 철강 생산 및 토양 안정화를 위해 주로 고객에게 마그네시아 기반 화학 제품과 백운암 석회를 생산합니다. 화학제품은 난연제, 폐수처리, 펄프, 종이 등에 사용됩니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":6160700000,"ni":866800000},{"y":2023,"rev":6777200000,"ni":1168900000},{"y":2024,"rev":6536000000,"ni":1995000000},{"y":2025,"rev":6150000000,"ni":1137000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":1534000000,"ni":279000000},{"q":"1Q2026",